description "Lieutenant Farien Jotarik

^2Weaponry:
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (EE-4 3)
- 3 Fragmentation Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

Lieutenant Jotarik comes from a long line of naval officers, but is the first of his family to serve in the Imperial forces. He has all the makings of a fine leader one day."